## Another Level 4 Title ##

There are **bold**, __italic__ and ~~strikethough~~ tags:

3 * 4 = 12 (you should see it normal); **3 * 4 = 12 (you should see it bold)**; __3 * 4 = 12 (you shoud see it italic)__; ~~3 * 4 = 12 (you shoud see it strikethrough)~~

All special entities are correctly represented:

